  "_comment": [
    "STAND-IN for two Connector API responses. This file exists only because the",
    "Connector API cannot be called from a browser — it needs ClientToken +",
    "AccessToken, which must never ship to a client. See SPRINGER-PAVILION.md.",
    "",
    "The shapes below are deliberately byte-compatible with the real responses, so",
    "swapping the mock for a server proxy is a URL change, not a rewrite:",
    "",
    "  Reservations[] ← POST /api/connector/v1/reservations/getAll/2023-06-06",
    "                    { Numbers: ['30291'], States: ['Confirmed','Started'] }",
    "  Customers[]    ← POST /api/connector/v1/customers/getAll",
    "                    { CustomerIds: ['<AccountId from above>'] }",
    "",
    "AgeCategoryIds are the REAL ones from the Cascadian demo enterprise",
    "(GET distributor /configuration/get → AgeCategories):",
    "  b5eb32b0-ba33-46cd-b579-b409011e186b  Adults",
    "  e8974775-321b-464d-8066-b409011e1a69  Seniors",
